<title>UK: Commerzbank sets 100 million stg four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets 100 million stg four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>joint lead managers Commerzbank AG and HSBC.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK OVERSEAS FINANCE NV (CURACAO)</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     7.25 PCT  MATURITY    29.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.876   PAY DATE   L16.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.476    SPREAD	+15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K)1-10-100 SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL/DE</p>
<p>NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC   1.40</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT 2000 GILT -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
